                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee07ef38-60a3-30db-892a-07e867c6b8b3",
                        "entry_id": "5fc241f8-9993-3019-85c0-2d5600c4e336",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lack of culture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89bacf5c-fe0c-4da5-af4a-a076e0bb45bc",
                                "sense_id": "ee07ef38-60a3-30db-892a-07e867c6b8b3",
                                "text": "Never was there any sterility, whereof there may not be a cause given. Either the season is unkindly parching with drought, or drenching with wet, or nipping with frost, or blasting with pernicious airs, or rotting with mildews: […] or some natural fault in the soil; or misdemeanour of the owners; idleness, ill-husbandry, in mistiming, neglect of meet helps, unculture, ill choice of seed: but, whatever be the second cause, we are sure who is the first; He turneth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23a5424c-2a29-4fdc-8972-e4f04ba113b7",
                                "sense_id": "ee07ef38-60a3-30db-892a-07e867c6b8b3",
                                "text": "Greed and craft, and even ferocity, are to be read in such faces, but rarely weakness, and never imbecility; roughness, unculture, and coarseness are there, not vulgarity, nor want of energy"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
